    content: `
      <div class="no-summary-image">Sorry, the summary image doesn't exist yet :(</div>
      <p>Let’s try something fun.</p>

      <p>Take two particles with the same mass, \\( m \\), and the same speed, \\( u \\), and have them move towards 
