      <p>Once again, for lower values of \\( v \\), this reduces back to Newtonian mechanics — \\( \\gamma \\approx 1 \\), 
      so \\( p \\approx m_0 v \\). But at high speeds? Oh, it matters. It matters a lot.</p>

      <h3>Relativistic Kinetic Energy</h3>

